            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Feldman, the case challenges Chicago\u2019s ordinance that bans handguns while permitting long guns."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Paul D. Clement",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d248debab271f27f098161db18a1e41be7a822e4a95bb4a2f9107ac539f8cc09",
