            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d248debab271-0000-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 18,
              "start": 18
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Petitioners argue that the Second Amendment protects an individual right that should be incorporated against the states through the Due Process Clause."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Feldman",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d248debab271f27f098161db18a1e41be7a822e4a95bb4a2f9107ac539f8cc09",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d248debab271-0003-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 60,
              "start": 60
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Feldman, respondents contend that Chicago\u2019s regulation is consistent with the historical tradition of allowing local governments to balance self\u2011defense needs with public safety."
      }
    ],
