          "text": "According to Alan Gura, Chicago\u2019s ordinances cannot survive the faithful application of due\u2011process doctrines; the Constitution\u2019s plain text mandates reversal of the lower court\u2019s judgment."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Paul D. Clement",
          "citations": [
