                "ev-d248debab271-0000-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 18,
                "start": 18
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Paul D. Clement, incorporating the Second Amendment through the Due Process Clause is straightforward because the amendment protects a fundamental pre\u2011existing right guaranteed to the people."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Gura",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "d248debab271f27f098161db18a1e41be7a822e4a95bb4a2f9107ac539f8cc09",
              "evidence_ids": [
