              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 62,
                "start": 62
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Gura, beyond the Second Amendment, other rights enumerated in the first eight amendments and certain unenumerated rights are also being denied by Chicago\u2019s ordinance."
        }
      ],
